From 26e49ab3c697010166577c5e2ddde4bed5da2aa8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qzshch <qzshch@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:31:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] feat(models): ring the sparse window during decode
 growth

ensure_sequence_kv_mapped now runs roll_sparse_decode_window under a sparse
configuration: once mapped pages exceed the window plus slack, pages outside
the sink prefix and newest window demote to Host replicas and the Main and
MTP entitlements re-clamp, so unbounded generation rings the window instead
of exhausting it. resize_entitlement's floor becomes the residency floor
(sparse membership may exceed the device guarantee), and the prefill roll
now demotes before growing the entitlement (the floor shrinks first).

cherry-src: cdc30a273b6a311c09ec582dffd2a528bd0b1bd9 [lease growth disabled under kvmem]
